(a) The utility shall develop resource plans to meet the needs identified by each demand forecast scenario described in section 158-772, and to achieve different policy objectives as identified by the collaborative working group (for example, minimizing customer bills, minimizing rates, minimizing customer direct costs, maximizing environmental protection, maximizing penetration of demand-side resources), based on the least-cost combination of the potential demand-side and supply-side resources assessed. The utility shall

